<doc id="67759" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=67759" title="Anna Pavlovna">
Anna Pavlovna

Anna Pavlovna &lt;a href="Santo%20Petersburg"&gt;Santo Petersburg&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="18%20Januari"&gt;18 Januari&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1795"&gt;1795&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="Den%20Haag"&gt;Den Haag&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="1%20Maret"&gt;1 Maret&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1865"&gt;1865&lt;/a&gt;), utawi asring dipunserat minangka &lt;a href="Anna%20Paulowna"&gt;Anna Paulowna&lt;/a&gt;, punika garwanipun &lt;a href="Monarki"&gt;Nata&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Willem%20II%20saka%20Walanda"&gt;Willem II&lt;/a&gt; saking &lt;a href="Walanda"&gt;Walandi&lt;/a&gt;. Kekalihipun palakrami tanggal &lt;a href="21%20F%C3%A8bruari"&gt;21 Fèbruari&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1816"&gt;1816&lt;/a&gt;.
Anna punika putri &lt;a href="tsar"&gt;tsar&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Paul%20I%20saka%20Ruslan"&gt;Paul I&lt;/a&gt; lan sadhèrek tsar &lt;a href="Alexander%20I%20saka%20Ruslan"&gt;Alexander I&lt;/a&gt;.
Willem II lan Anna pikantuk 3 tiga putra: &lt;a href="Willem%20III"&gt;Willem III saking Walandi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Pang%C3%A9ran%20Hendrik%20saking%20Luxemburg"&gt;Pangéran Hendrik saking Luxemburg&lt;/a&gt; lan Sophie.
Tiyang Walandi nyebat panjenenganipun "Anna Paulowna" lan kitha &lt;a href="Anna%20Paulowna"&gt;Anna Paulowna&lt;/a&gt; dipunparingi nama makaten kanggé ngurmati panjenenganipun.
