Ne-Yo lair ing &lt;a href="Arkansas"&gt;Arkansas&lt;/a&gt; kanthi jeneng &lt;a href="baptis"&gt;baptis&lt;/a&gt; Shaffer Chimere Smith. Bapaké warga Amérika katurunan &lt;a href="Afrika"&gt;Afrika&lt;/a&gt; lan ibuné warga Amérika Afrika katurunan &lt;a href="China"&gt;China&lt;/a&gt;, kaloroné musisi. Wektu isih cilik,dhèwèké dimomong déning ibuné dhéwé sawisé pisah saka bapaké.
<h2>Karier</h2>
Karier.
Wiwitan karier Ne=Yo minangka salah siji personil saka grup vokal kuartet Envy, nanging karier grup mau ora suwé, sebab mung tahan nganti taun 2000.
Ne-Yo banjur dikontrak déning parusahan &lt;a href="Colombia%20Recording"&gt;Colombia Recording&lt;/a&gt;.
Nganti saiki, Ne-yo wis duwé 3 buah album studio, ya iku &lt;a href="In%20My%20Own%20Words"&gt;In My Own Words&lt;/a&gt; (dirilis ing taun 2006), &lt;a href="Because%20of%20You"&gt;Because of You&lt;/a&gt; (rilis taun 2007), lan album &lt;a href="Year%20of%20the%20Gentleman"&gt;Year of the Gentleman&lt;/a&gt; (rilis ing taun 2008).
Karier Ne-Yo ora mung mddi penyanyi, nanging uga ngripta lagu kanggo awaké dhéwé lan penyanyi liya, kaya &lt;a href="Rihanna"&gt;Rihanna&lt;/a&gt; (lagu &lt;a href="A%20Girl%20Like%20Me"&gt;Unfaithful&lt;/a&gt; lan lagu &lt;a href="Good%20Girl%20Gone%20Bad"&gt;Take a Bow&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Mario%20Vazquez"&gt;Mario Vazquez&lt;/a&gt; (lagu Gallery), &lt;a href="Paula%20DeAnda"&gt;Paula DeAnda&lt;/a&gt; (lagu Walk Away (Remember Me)), lan &lt;a href="Beyonc%C3%A9%20Knowles"&gt;Beyoncé Knowles&lt;/a&gt; (lagu &lt;a href="B%27Day"&gt;Irreplaceable&lt;/a&gt;)
Ne-Yo uga ngripta lagu kanggo &lt;a href="Whitney%20Houston"&gt;Whitney Houston&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Celine%20Dion"&gt;Celine Dion&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Corbin%20Bleu"&gt;Corbin Bleu&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Enrique%20Iglesias"&gt;Enrique Iglesias&lt;/a&gt;.
Lan ing mangsa ngarep, dhèwèké bakal ngripta lagu bebarengan karo &lt;a href="will.i.am"&gt;will.i.am&lt;/a&gt; kanggo album &lt;a href="Michael%20Jackson"&gt;Michael Jackson&lt;/a&gt;.
