Enemy at the Gates

<ol>
<li>ALIH</<li>
</ol>
Enemy at the Gates iku sawijining &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; sing di&lt;a href="sutradara"&gt;sutradara&lt;/a&gt;ni déning &lt;a href="Jean-Jacques%20Annaud"&gt;Jean-Jacques Annaud&lt;/a&gt; ing taun &lt;a href="2001"&gt;2001&lt;/a&gt;, lan diadhaptasi saka sawijining buku sing ditulis déning &lt;a href="William%20Craig"&gt;William Craig&lt;/a&gt; sing nyritakaké kadadéan-kadadéan lan prastawa-prastawa saubengé &lt;a href="Perang%20Donya%20II"&gt;Perang Donya II&lt;/a&gt;. Sawijining penémbak jitu ya iku &lt;a href="Vasily%20Zaitsev"&gt;Vasily Zaitsev&lt;/a&gt; saka kubu &lt;a href="Uni%20Soviet"&gt;Uni Soviet&lt;/a&gt; nglawan &lt;a href="rival"&gt;rival&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt;né, &lt;a href="Mayor"&gt;Mayor&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Heinz%20Thorvald"&gt;Heinz Thorvald&lt;/a&gt;, ing &lt;a href="Perang%20Stalingrad"&gt;Perang Stalingrad&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="1942"&gt;1942&lt;/a&gt;.
Maksud filem iki ya iku kanggo nggambaraké peran &lt;a href="propagandha"&gt;propagandha&lt;/a&gt; ing kaloro kubu sajeroning perang iki lan migunakaké paprangan &lt;a href="sniper"&gt;panémbak jitu&lt;/a&gt; (sniper-warfare) minangka &lt;a href="metafora"&gt;metafora&lt;/a&gt; pertempuran dahsyat antara kaloro wadyabala bala.
Film iki akèh dikritik ing &lt;a href="Ruslan"&gt;Ruslan&lt;/a&gt; lan ing &lt;a href="%C3%89ropa"&gt;Éropa&lt;/a&gt; amarga dianggep ora akurat kanthi historis. Sanadyan mangkono, filem iki cukup suksès.
Semboyan: A hero never chooses his destiny. His destiny chooses him. ("Seorang pahlawan tidak memilih nasibnya. Nasiblah yang memilihnya").
