<doc id="68744" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=68744" title="Pieter Willem Botha">
Pieter Willem Botha

Pieter Willem Botha, (Paul-Roux, &lt;a href="Free%20State"&gt;Free State&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="12%20Januari"&gt;12 Januari&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1916"&gt;1916&lt;/a&gt;–&lt;a href="Western%20Cape"&gt;Western Cape&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="31%20Oktober"&gt;31 Oktober&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt;), biasanpun dipunundang "P.W." lan "Die Groot Krokodil" salebetipun &lt;a href="basa%20Afrika"&gt;basa Afrika&lt;/a&gt; ingkang tegesipun "Si Baya Ageng", punika &lt;a href="Mahamantri%20Afrika%20Kidul"&gt;Mahamantri&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Afrika%20Kidul"&gt;Afrika Kidul&lt;/a&gt; wiwit taun &lt;a href="1978"&gt;1978&lt;/a&gt; dumugi taun &lt;a href="1984"&gt;1984&lt;/a&gt; lan ugi &lt;a href="Pr%C3%A9sidh%C3%A8n%20Afrika%20Kidul"&gt;présidhèn&lt;/a&gt; wiwit taun &lt;a href="1984"&gt;1984&lt;/a&gt; dumugi taun &lt;a href="1989"&gt;1989&lt;/a&gt;.
Botha punika panyengkuyung lami &lt;a href="Part%C3%A9%20Nasioanl%20%28Afrika%20Kidul%29"&gt;Parté Nasional&lt;/a&gt; Afrika Kidul lan panganjur kukuh segregasi rasial lan sistem &lt;a href="apartheid"&gt;apartheid&lt;/a&gt;.
