<doc id="68974" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=68974" title="Condoleezza Rice">
Condoleezza Rice

Condoleezza Rice, &lt;a href="Doctor%20of%20Philosophy"&gt;Ph.D.&lt;/a&gt; (kadhang karan Condi Rice) (#ALIH), iku mantan &lt;a href="Mantri%20Jaban%20Rangkah%20AS"&gt;Mantri Jaban Rangkah AS&lt;/a&gt;. Condoleezza iku wanita &lt;a href="Afriangka%20Am%C3%A9rika"&gt;Afriangka Amérika&lt;/a&gt; pisanan, wong Afriangka Amérika kaloro (sawisé &lt;a href="Colin%20Powell"&gt;Colin Powell&lt;/a&gt;), lan wanita kaloro (sawisé &lt;a href="Madeleine%20Albright"&gt;Madeleine Albright&lt;/a&gt;) sing njabat ing posisi iki.
Rice minangka &lt;a href="Penasehat%20Keamanan%20Nasional%20AS"&gt;Penasehat Keamanan Nasional AS&lt;/a&gt; marang &lt;a href="Pr%C3%A9sidh%C3%A8n%20AS"&gt;Présidhèn&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="George%20W.%20Bush"&gt;George W. Bush&lt;/a&gt; ing mangsa bakti pisanan.
